{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"108009","name":"Miramare Queen","description":"The hotel is located in the popular region of Kumköy on the outskirts of the historical city of Side, 6 kms away. The beach is just 100 metres from the hotel and Antalya Airport is 60 kms with the market town of Manavgat just 12 kms away. The well-established hotel with spacious grounds features a large indoor restaurant and an outdoor, shaded snack bar. The air-conditioned property comprises 319 guest rooms. Younger guests will enjoy the kids' club and playground. The main pool has a fountain feature in the centre and is bordered by sun terraces and well maintained gardens with grass lawns and palm trees providing shade. Children can enjoy their own swimming area. Refreshments are served at the poolside snack bar. The hotel entertainment team arranges day and evening programmes, organise games, sports and shows, and ensure lots of fun.","address":"Ilıca Mahallesi 310 Sokak No: 3 Kumköy Mevkii","city":"SIDE","countryCode":"TR","postalCode":"07400","lat":36.804312,"lng":31.353571,"stars":5,"chain":"MIRHO","giataCode":"4894","phone":"+902427561122","email":"miramare@miramarehotels.com","website":"www.miramarehotels.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/108009/108009a_hb_a_011.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/108009/108009a_hb_a_021.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/108009/108009a_hb_a_023.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/108009/108009a_hb_a_025.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/108009/108009a_hb_a_027.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/108009/108009a_hb_a_036.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/108009/108009a_hb_a_0